WEBVTT

00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:13.570
<i>A new kind of disease has been 
spreading among young people.</i>

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:17.530
<i>Following prolonged 
periods of Internet usage,</i>

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:23.260
<i>sufferers develop a pathological 
dependence on the Internet.</i>

00:00:23.770 --> 00:00:27.860
<i>Experts have named this 
disease "Internet Addiction."</i>

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:32.650
<i>In order to get these addicted 
youngsters back on the right track</i>

00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:39.440
<i>and reform them into independent, 
self-respecting adults,</i>

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:46.460
<i>the Elite Reeducation Academy, 
a civilian educational facility, was created.</i>

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:53.750
<i>It is a place to help young 
people to grow up right.</i>

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:29.530
<i>He talked his way past the instructors.</i>

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:31.500
Episode 2 
Between Cruelty and Kindness

00:02:29.530 --> 00:02:32.350
<i>Incredible. He wasn't lying!</i>

00:02:32.800 --> 00:02:37.080
<i>Does that mean he wasn't 
lying about Shiori, either?</i>

00:02:54.620 --> 00:02:55.980
Wudo.

00:02:56.200 --> 00:02:57.570
Hey!

00:02:57.570 --> 00:02:58.450
Shin.

00:02:58.450 --> 00:02:59.510
A moment of your time?

00:03:11.610 --> 00:03:14.090
Watch. Something 
interesting's about to happen.

00:03:16.780 --> 00:03:18.530
Wh-What are you doing?

00:03:19.710 --> 00:03:22.200
Just hold still. Don't bother fighting it.

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:23.990
Stop it! Let me go!

00:03:28.200 --> 00:03:28.920
What?!

00:03:28.920 --> 00:03:31.260
Is this the "something interesting" 
you were talking about?

00:03:31.260 --> 00:03:32.500
Just watch.

00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:36.610
Wh-What are you doing?

00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:38.630
Hey! Let me go!

00:03:39.990 --> 00:03:42.490
Yeah! I found it!

00:03:43.300 --> 00:03:45.780
I knew you had a damned 
phone hidden on you.

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:48.300
You know that phones 
are contraband here.

00:03:48.300 --> 00:03:51.510
I bet you know what happens 
to people who smuggle 'em in, too.

00:03:54.210 --> 00:03:55.290
Give it back!

00:03:56.440 --> 00:03:58.110
Give it back, I said!

00:04:01.230 --> 00:04:03.970
You hiding anything else? 
You'd better hand it over.

00:04:04.560 --> 00:04:05.490
Hey, Officer.

00:04:05.490 --> 00:04:07.770
Why don't we strip search her?

00:04:14.930 --> 00:04:18.360
Please, give back my phone!

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:22.500
I can't survive here without my phone!

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:26.990
That's some serious 
Internet addiction you got.

00:04:26.990 --> 00:04:29.610
It's like you're not sorry at all.

00:04:29.610 --> 00:04:32.020
You've got this coming to you.

00:04:39.050 --> 00:04:40.190
Stop it!

00:04:40.190 --> 00:04:41.590
I'm begging you!

00:04:44.640 --> 00:04:48.680
This is on my authority 
as discipline officer.

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:55.480
Th-This is awful.

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:58.830
Stop it! Stop! Someone help me!

00:04:58.830 --> 00:05:00.060
Stop it!

00:05:00.730 --> 00:05:02.480
You stupid bitch!

00:05:02.480 --> 00:05:05.000
You <i>are</i> hiding something!

00:05:05.670 --> 00:05:06.510
Stop.

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:14.010
Wudo. You stupid pig.

00:05:14.010 --> 00:05:16.000
Let her go right now.

00:05:16.270 --> 00:05:17.610
If you don't,

00:05:17.610 --> 00:05:22.500
I'll slice off those trotters of yours 
and serve you pig's feet for dinner.

00:05:31.470 --> 00:05:32.540
Well, well.

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:35.180
The student council president, is it?

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:38.170
Come on, I have proof and everything.

00:05:38.170 --> 00:05:39.740
Everyone saw it.

00:05:39.740 --> 00:05:41.290
You still want to cover for her?

00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:43.550
Punishment is up to the 
instructors to dish out.

00:05:44.020 --> 00:05:45.840
You're acting outside of your purview.

00:05:46.380 --> 00:05:48.820
Shiori's... the student council president?

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:50.490
Let that girl go.

00:05:50.490 --> 00:05:52.830
Didn't you hear what I said?

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:54.370
Stop giving orders!

00:06:06.850 --> 00:06:08.170
What a beginner.

00:06:08.170 --> 00:06:12.120
Looks like your spirit 
is as puny as you are.

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:14.180
I'll be less merciful next time.

00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:18.550
I'm gonna pound you!

00:06:19.590 --> 00:06:20.710
Shiori!

00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:36.370
Now, Officer.

00:06:36.370 --> 00:06:38.340
Are you ready to back off?

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:41.850
Or are you going to keep 
hiding behind your underlings?

00:06:43.470 --> 00:06:46.120
Officer, she's getting way too 
stuck-up. I can't stand it.

00:06:46.120 --> 00:06:48.260
Yeah! We need to teach her a lesson!

00:06:48.260 --> 00:06:49.820
Hey, you guys!

00:06:49.820 --> 00:06:51.130
What are you doing?

00:06:51.130 --> 00:06:52.300
Crap!

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:53.960
What's all this noise?

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:57.800
School grounds are not the 
place for this! Understand?!

00:06:58.720 --> 00:07:01.300
Well, we got the cell phone. Let's go.

00:07:01.980 --> 00:07:03.690
We'll settle up with her next time.

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:05.850
Get back to your classrooms! Hurry up!

00:07:15.850 --> 00:07:17.900
Th-Thanks...

00:07:18.640 --> 00:07:19.710
Excuse me.

00:07:19.710 --> 00:07:21.350
You there, on the ground.

00:07:24.330 --> 00:07:25.900
Pick up that brick.

00:07:25.900 --> 00:07:27.300
We don't want someone tripping.

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:28.860
R-Right.

00:07:29.560 --> 00:07:31.110
Wait.

00:07:31.110 --> 00:07:32.800
Aren't you...

00:07:33.690 --> 00:07:35.820
Shiori. You remember me?

00:07:40.080 --> 00:07:41.620
I'll give you some first-aid.

00:07:41.620 --> 00:07:42.720
Come with me.

00:07:42.720 --> 00:07:46.520
O-Okay.

00:07:46.520 --> 00:07:51.000
So there was a student who gave you that 
much trouble, Head Instructor Shian?

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:52.830
He must really be something,

00:07:52.830 --> 00:07:56.940
to make you late to the quarterly meeting.

00:07:56.940 --> 00:07:58.590
Hyo-san, leave him alone.

00:07:58.590 --> 00:08:01.300
You know how much the head 
instructor cares about the students.

00:08:01.300 --> 00:08:05.130
We got new students in today, 
and that took a bit of time, that's all.

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:06.770
Enough of this pointless chatter.

00:08:06.770 --> 00:08:07.780
What about the meeting?

00:08:07.780 --> 00:08:10.340
The meeting is already over.

00:08:10.600 --> 00:08:13.730
Instructor Ryo can explain 
the details to you.

00:08:13.730 --> 00:08:15.060
I'm leaving.

00:08:15.060 --> 00:08:16.820
I'll see you out.

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:19.430
Oh, and Head Instructor.

00:08:19.430 --> 00:08:22.800
I hope you'll give that 
child your full attention.{check nuance}

00:08:23.090 --> 00:08:28.180
You know what will happen 
if anything goes wrong, right?

00:08:29.710 --> 00:08:31.320
Head Instructor.

00:08:31.830 --> 00:08:34.240
You do need to atone for your sin.

00:08:50.580 --> 00:08:51.380
Does it hurt?

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:53.770
No... I'm fine.

00:08:53.770 --> 00:08:55.980
But that discipline officer...

00:08:55.980 --> 00:08:57.780
he's pretty full of himself, huh?

00:08:57.780 --> 00:09:00.470
Wudo thinks he's a mob boss.

00:09:00.470 --> 00:09:02.140
He's an animal.

00:09:03.640 --> 00:09:06.480
But... you're pretty incredible.

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:08.640
You weren't afraid at all.

00:09:09.640 --> 00:09:12.190
You stood up to him like a real hero.

00:09:12.870 --> 00:09:15.160
Just like in middle school...

00:09:16.060 --> 00:09:18.640
Shiori, do you remember me?

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:33.890
You damned pervert.

00:09:33.890 --> 00:09:35.620
That wasn't necessary!

00:09:35.620 --> 00:09:38.270
It's a natural response 
for a healthy young man!

00:09:39.530 --> 00:09:41.020
We're done here.

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:45.990
Let's talk about a trade.

00:09:47.090 --> 00:09:48.310
A trade?

00:09:48.310 --> 00:09:49.600
Of course, a trade.

00:09:49.600 --> 00:09:53.970
Why do you think I went to the trouble 
of opposing Wudo to save you?

00:09:53.970 --> 00:09:57.490
You think I was just trying 
to be a good person?

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:02.570
W-Wait. What are you talking about?

00:10:02.570 --> 00:10:04.170
You're the student 
council president, right?

00:10:04.170 --> 00:10:05.730
Of course you're a good person!

00:10:05.730 --> 00:10:08.960
It's only natural you'd want 
to get my phone back for me!

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:13.110
Hey, please! I can't talk to my 
boyfriend without that phone!

00:10:13.110 --> 00:10:15.460
I'm locked away in here, bullied...

00:10:15.460 --> 00:10:18.460
Keeping in contact with him
 is my only ray of hope!

00:10:18.890 --> 00:10:22.200
Hey, please! Help me!

00:10:23.210 --> 00:10:25.270
I have one request.

00:10:25.270 --> 00:10:28.640
You managed to smuggle it
 through that strict inspection.

00:10:28.640 --> 00:10:30.440
You can get another one in, can't you?

00:10:30.640 --> 00:10:33.310
I need a cell phone, too.

00:10:33.850 --> 00:10:34.950
But...

00:10:39.110 --> 00:10:42.190
If you succeed, I'll teach 
you how to use a knife.

00:10:42.930 --> 00:10:44.260
You mean...

00:10:44.260 --> 00:10:47.130
if I can use a knife, 
I won't be bullied anymore?

00:10:47.130 --> 00:10:48.700
I can protect myself?

00:10:48.700 --> 00:10:50.000
Not just that.

00:10:50.840 --> 00:10:55.020
If no one comes to save you
 the next time you're bullied...

00:10:55.610 --> 00:10:58.780
You can use that to kill yourself.

00:10:58.780 --> 00:11:00.990
It's better than being bullied, right?

00:11:02.490 --> 00:11:04.920
In exchange for risking 
my life to get you a cell phone,

00:11:04.920 --> 00:11:07.190
you want to teach me 
how to commit suicide?

00:11:07.190 --> 00:11:08.450
That's stupid!

00:11:08.450 --> 00:11:10.990
If I could smuggle another in just 
like that, I wouldn't need your help!

00:11:14.070 --> 00:11:16.370
Fine. Disappear.

00:11:16.980 --> 00:11:19.990
Don't count on my protection again.

00:11:23.860 --> 00:11:25.010
Shiori!

00:11:28.800 --> 00:11:32.520
Maybe you've forgotten, but I remember.

00:11:33.200 --> 00:11:36.740
You used to be really nice. 
Everyone liked you.

00:11:36.740 --> 00:11:39.070
When did you become someone so cold?

00:11:39.070 --> 00:11:41.970
When did you start talking 
about hurting people?

00:11:41.970 --> 00:11:45.470
The reason I was able to get back on my 
feet then was because you were there.

00:11:50.640 --> 00:11:51.990
Are you done?

00:11:53.380 --> 00:11:54.990
No, not yet! I...

00:11:58.250 --> 00:12:00.640
If you're done, then disappear.

00:12:02.140 --> 00:12:03.980
If you don't,

00:12:03.980 --> 00:12:06.400
the next place this knife is going

00:12:06.400 --> 00:12:08.200
is into your tongue.

00:12:09.410 --> 00:12:11.020
I see.

00:12:14.330 --> 00:12:17.090
That's the student council president I know.

00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:20.550
She really brings the fire 
with the new students.

00:12:20.550 --> 00:12:23.110
What do you want? 
I didn't ask for your opinion.

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:27.760
Want to hear my conditions?

00:12:27.770 --> 00:12:31.000
I think you'll be interested 
in what I have to say.

00:12:31.760 --> 00:12:34.360
That's... my cell phone!

00:12:34.360 --> 00:12:35.600
Give it to me!

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:38.250
Don't move.

00:12:38.250 --> 00:12:41.110
I have a need for that cell phone, too.

00:12:42.010 --> 00:12:43.990
So, what's the deal?

00:12:43.990 --> 00:12:46.310
It's simple.

00:12:46.310 --> 00:12:49.780
One of you two, take that 
innocent little lamb over there

00:12:49.780 --> 00:12:54.050
and make him a man.

00:12:54.050 --> 00:12:57.020
What? Hey, no, I wasn't... really...

00:12:58.030 --> 00:12:59.280
I knew it.

00:12:59.280 --> 00:13:03.530
Men are nothing but animals 
controlled by their lusts.

00:13:07.240 --> 00:13:09.140
Hey, you...

00:13:09.140 --> 00:13:11.200
You really are a good person, right?

00:13:11.200 --> 00:13:14.160
So please, don't make me suffer.

00:13:14.860 --> 00:13:17.730
I promised myself that my first time 
would be with my boyfriend.

00:13:17.730 --> 00:13:19.650
And I don't know anything, either...

00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:22.060
So please, call it off, won't you?

00:13:23.720 --> 00:13:28.410
Although, if you'd be gentle with me...

00:13:28.410 --> 00:13:31.060
If you wouldn't do anything cruel...

00:13:31.060 --> 00:13:35.020
<i>What does she mean, if I'll be gentle?</i>

00:13:35.020 --> 00:13:36.350
<i>Is she coming on to me?</i>

00:13:36.820 --> 00:13:40.340
<i>You saw that Shiori wanted 
that cell phone, Hibiki.</i>

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:43.310
<i>If you have any spine at all, 
you'll take your friend's side.</i>

00:13:46.240 --> 00:13:47.990
I'll give your phone back.

00:13:47.990 --> 00:13:49.510
It's yours, anyway.

00:13:49.510 --> 00:13:50.970
You idiot! What are you saying?

00:13:51.180 --> 00:13:52.420
Really?

00:13:52.420 --> 00:13:55.360
I knew you were a good person!

00:13:56.660 --> 00:13:58.940
<i>I get to do it with a girl!</i>

00:13:58.940 --> 00:14:02.000
<i>Why should I care who it is?</i>

00:14:05.800 --> 00:14:08.800
You've shown me that a person's 
ability to get through life

00:14:08.800 --> 00:14:11.860
depends on the quality of their performance.{check}

00:14:11.860 --> 00:14:14.060
And you've gotten very good at it.

00:14:14.740 --> 00:14:16.540
Jun, age 16.

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:18.910
Blood type AB. Gemini.

00:14:18.910 --> 00:14:21.180
Your favorite colors are orange and pink.

00:14:21.180 --> 00:14:24.690
Two years ago, you became obsessed with 
an idol unit and began chasing them.

00:14:24.690 --> 00:14:29.000
You ended up stealing from your 
parents, so they grounded you.

00:14:29.000 --> 00:14:33.280
Afterwards, you obtained the 
SNS ID of one of the members,

00:14:33.280 --> 00:14:36.580
friended him, and soon fell in love.

00:14:36.580 --> 00:14:40.100
Then you stole your parents' 
bank card password

00:14:40.100 --> 00:14:42.500
and started pouring money 
to his bank account.{check}

00:14:43.010 --> 00:14:45.440
But it turned out he wasn't really a member,

00:14:45.440 --> 00:14:49.000
and he had fooled a number 
of other girls like you.

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:52.020
Even knowing that, you began working for him,

00:14:52.020 --> 00:14:54.610
even defrauding other fans.

00:14:55.310 --> 00:14:57.920
Before long, another victim reported him.

00:14:57.920 --> 00:15:01.000
You should have been sent to 
the police as an accomplice,

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:04.330
but your parents pulled strings 
and had you placed in this school.

00:15:04.330 --> 00:15:07.300
I don't know how you  
smuggled a phone in here,

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:11.760
but knowing you, you worked your wiles 
on an instructor to get it done.

00:15:13.650 --> 00:15:17.480
You're awful. How dare 
you slander me like this!

00:15:18.730 --> 00:15:20.340
Come on, it's the truth.

00:15:20.780 --> 00:15:22.980
I've had my eye on you for a long time.

00:15:22.980 --> 00:15:26.040
You play the good girl so aggressively 
that it backfires on you.

00:15:26.480 --> 00:15:32.490
And I'm the one who told Wudo 
that you might have a cell phone.

00:15:35.290 --> 00:15:36.510
<i>You son of a...</i>

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:46.000
I'm done with you. Disappear.

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:48.900
I'll get you for this! All three of you!

00:15:51.130 --> 00:15:56.760
It looks like you have a way to use 
the Internet whenever you want to.

00:15:56.760 --> 00:15:59.540
You also have information 
that other people don't.

00:15:59.540 --> 00:16:00.480
However...

00:16:00.480 --> 00:16:02.990
what if I took that away by force?

00:16:02.990 --> 00:16:05.270
This? If you want it, you can have it.

00:16:05.270 --> 00:16:06.430
I don't mind.

00:16:06.430 --> 00:16:10.300
But it's just a pamphlet, you know.

00:16:10.300 --> 00:16:12.000
I never said it was a cell phone.

00:16:12.640 --> 00:16:15.000
If you really do want a cell phone, though,

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:17.150
stop threatening me with a knife,

00:16:17.150 --> 00:16:19.520
and give some thought to my proposal.

00:16:19.520 --> 00:16:21.220
Um... Shin?

00:16:21.220 --> 00:16:24.420
Please, enough. 
It's not right to do this to Shiori.

00:16:24.420 --> 00:16:25.510
Shut up!

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:35.580
Fine.

00:16:35.580 --> 00:16:36.390
I'll do it.

00:16:38.410 --> 00:16:40.470
But if you're lying to me...

00:16:40.470 --> 00:16:43.800
Don't worry. Given your knife skills, 
I wouldn't even try.

00:16:44.290 --> 00:16:46.720
But you can't fool me.

00:16:49.330 --> 00:16:52.990
Make sure you bring me proof.

00:17:02.420 --> 00:17:03.680
Shiori?

00:17:10.100 --> 00:17:12.850
<i>I haven't seen Shiori in three years.</i>

00:17:12.850 --> 00:17:15.610
<i>This should be a joyous reunion.</i>

00:17:15.610 --> 00:17:20.470
<i>But meeting her in a place like this... 
and having to do <i>that</i>...</i>

00:17:21.340 --> 00:17:22.290
<i>I can't do it!</i>

00:17:22.290 --> 00:17:23.560
<i>This is a dirty way of doing things.</i>

00:17:23.560 --> 00:17:24.760
<i>But...</i>

00:17:26.260 --> 00:17:28.330
<i>Say something, Hibiki!</i>

00:17:28.330 --> 00:17:29.810
<i>If you're a man, then be a man!</i>

00:17:29.810 --> 00:17:33.400
<i>Just decide if you're going 
to go through it or not!</i>

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:37.170
<i>A real man would never threaten a girl!</i>

00:17:37.860 --> 00:17:40.980
<i>This is your big chance, 
and you're not gonna do anything?</i>

00:17:40.980 --> 00:17:43.530
<i>Only an idiot would let this chance 
slip through his fingers!</i>

00:17:43.530 --> 00:17:45.770
<i>You'll look much cooler 
if you just walk away!</i>

00:17:45.770 --> 00:17:46.320
<i>Shut up!</i>

00:17:46.320 --> 00:17:50.260
<i>You can't find love unless you grab it 
by the horns, just like in a manga!</i>

00:17:50.260 --> 00:17:52.240
<i>Real life isn't manga!</i>

00:17:52.240 --> 00:17:55.880
<i>If you want to win a girl's heart, 
patience is what pays!</i>

00:17:56.090 --> 00:17:57.020
<i>Shut up!</i>

00:17:57.020 --> 00:17:57.510
<i>What?</i>

00:17:57.510 --> 00:17:58.670
<i>That hurt!</i>

00:17:58.670 --> 00:17:59.620
Enough!

00:18:00.610 --> 00:18:03.410
I don't want a physical connection 
with no emotion behind it.

00:18:03.410 --> 00:18:05.890
I can't do it! If I were to 
do something so shameless...

00:18:05.890 --> 00:18:07.510
Shiori, don't worry.

00:18:07.510 --> 00:18:09.160
I won't take advantage of you.

00:18:09.160 --> 00:18:11.790
If you want to use a phone 
and have Internet, I'll...

